BT 1 0 0 1 4 382.8 Tm /F4 8.2 Tf 11.5 TL (// TIER S -- additive, zero porting cost) Tj T* (Add Passage: PassageName \(or full <tw-passagedata> format\)) Tj T* (Add Javascript:  Add CSS:  Add Events:  Add Function [name]:  Add Variable [name]: value) Tj T* (Rename Passage [OldName]: NewName  Move Passage [OldName] To [NewName]:) Tj T* (Add Tag To Passage [Name]: tag  Remove Tag From Passage [Name]: tag) Tj T*  T* (// TIER 1 -- passage name anchor) Tj T* (Prepend To Passage [Name]: With: content) Tj T* (Append To Passage [Name]: With: content) Tj T*  T* (// TIER 2 -- near-zero porting cost) Tj T* (Hook [setup.existingFunc]: before: | after: | around: \(v0.7.0\)) Tj T* (Insert Before [anchorString]: With: code  Insert After [anchorString]: With: code) Tj T*  T* (// TIER 2.5 -- scoped, moderate porting cost) Tj T* (Insert Into Function [setup.func]: anchor  With: code after anchor) Tj T* (Replace In Function [setup.func]: anchor  With: replacement) Tj T* (Delete In Passage [PassageName]: text to delete) Tj T*  T* (// TIER 3 -- moderate porting cost) Tj T* (Replace Function [setup.existingFunc]:  // complete body, no braces) Tj T* (Replace Function Signature [setup.func]: newParam1, newParam2) Tj T*  T* (// TIER 4-5 -- higher porting cost) Tj T* (Replace In Passage [PassageName]: anchor  With: replacement) Tj T* (Delete Span [start anchor] To [end anchor]:) Tj T* (ReplaceReg [\(?s\)prefix\(CAPTURE\)suffix]: With{1}: replacement for group 1) Tj T* (Replace: <exact HTML>  With: [raw Twine -- auto-escaped in v0.7.0]) Tj T*  T* (// STRUCTURAL -- anchors on name) Tj T* (Append Array [arrayName In Function [setup.init]]: "new item",) Tj T* (Append Variable to Class [ClassName]: this.newProp = 0;) Tj T* (Append Function to Class [ClassName]: newMethod\(\) { return this.newProp; }) Tj T* (Insert Into Array [arrayName]: "item",) Tj T* ET
Q
 

